      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nIn `docker/npu.Dockerfile` the Ascend `ENV` definitions were placed *after* the\r\nsglang editable install, so every earlier `RUN` step had to manually source\r\n`/etc/environment_new` to see CANN paths, and the final image exposed no CANN\r\nenvironment to `docker exec` shells. Both make the image hard to extend and to\r\ndebug.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Pin `SHELL [\"/bin/bash\", \"-c\"]` so `RUN` steps are parsed by bash consistently.\r\n- Move `ASCEND_HOME_PATH` and `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` up to right after the base image\r\n  `ARG` block, so all later layers inherit them, and drop the now-redundant\r\n  `. /etc/environment_new &&` prefixes from the torch/torch-npu, ModelScope/EvalScope\r\n  and pybind11/triton-ascend steps.\r\n- Set `ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH` to the `custom_transformer` and `customize` OPP\r\n  vendors after the custom ops are built.\r\n- Generate `/etc/profile.d/ascend.sh`, sourcing the `customize` and\r\n  `custom_transformer` `set_env.bash`, `ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh` and\r\n  `nnal/atb/set_env.sh`, and source it from `/etc/bash.bashrc` so interactive\r\n  shells match the build environment.\r\n- Harden the `deep-ep` symlink step by capturing the pip install location in\r\n  `PIPDIR`, asserting it is non-empty, and only then `cd` into it.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nNot applicable — the change only touches `docker/npu.Dockerfile`.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nNot applicable — the change only touches `docker/npu.Dockerfile`.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] ...\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38496827362](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38496827362)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38496827340](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38496827340)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
